  <data name="TheSeasonOfBlessingHasCome" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>The season of blessing has come and the Golden Archer who collects Rena has appeared on the MU continent. If you take 10 Rena to the Golden Archer who stands in front of Lorencia, he will tell you a story about himself.</value>
